      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Yunus, from Is’haq Bin Ammar who said, ",
          "‘Abu Al-Hassan<sup>asws</sup> said to me: ‘The lost, one should wait with his wealth for four years, then distribute it’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "5. Yunus has narrated from Ishaq ibn ‘Ammar who has narrated the following: “Abu al-Hassan, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, said to me, ‘The assets of a lost person must be kept for four years; then they are distributed.’” "
        ]
      }
